          "expr": "sum(ray_resources{Name=\"GPU\", State=\"USED\"}) / sum(ray_resources{Name=\"GPU\"})",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Share of the cluster's GPUs reserved by Ray tasks and actors (num_gpus). This is Ray's scheduling view, not hardware utilization: a reserved GPU can sit idle. Compare with GPU Utilization below."
