          },
          "expr": "sum by (Reason) (ray_scheduler_unscheduleable_tasks)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{Reason}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Why queued tasks can't schedule yet. Infeasible: no node can ever fit the request. WaitingForResources: the cluster is busy. WaitingForPlasmaMemory: the object store is full. WaitingForWorkers: worker processes are still starting (e.g. installing a runtime_env)."
